===================Day 24==================
What is Class: A class is a Template
What is object: An object[copy] is a copy of class[template]
How is class and Object Related: NameOfTheClassWhoseCopyYouWantToCreate objectName= new NameOfTheClassWhoseCopyYouWantToCreate();
Object w.r.t main(): A class with main provides us space to create object of any class
Class & Object w.r.t Heap & Stack Memory: Object is in Heap memory, reference variable is in stack memory and Class[Template] is in Metaspace
Null reference object
No reference Object
Garbage Collector
Object assignments to each other

